#, python-brace-format
msgid "Open an expert shell in this offline system."
msgstr "Buka shell ahli di sistem offline ini."

#: src/anduinos_rescue_center/app.py:612
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Review the installation before making changes."
msgstr "Tinjau instalasi sebelum melakukan perubahan."

#: src/anduinos_rescue_center/app.py:633
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Snapshot restore is available only for the standard AnduinOS Btrfs layout. "
"File recovery and password reset remain available here."
msgstr ""
"Pemulihan snapshot hanya tersedia untuk tata letak Btrfs standar AnduinOS. "
"Pemulihan berkas dan pengaturan ulang kata sandi tetap tersedia di sini."

#: src/anduinos_rescue_center/app.py:640
#, python-brace-format
msgid "ADVANCED RECOVERY"
msgstr "PEMULIHAN LANJUTAN"

#: src/anduinos_rescue_center/app.py:641
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Open a root shell inside the selected offline system. Commands can change or"
" delete its files."
msgstr ""
"Buka shell root di dalam sistem offline yang dipilih. Perintah dapat "
"mengubah atau menghapus berkasnya."

#: src/anduinos_rescue_center/app.py:644
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The terminal will show the target partition before entering it. Type exit "
"when finished. Recovery will unmount its temporary filesystems and report "
"any cleanup failure."
msgstr ""
"Terminal akan menampilkan partisi target sebelum membukanya. Ketik exit "
"setelah selesai. Proses pemulihan akan meng-unmount sistem berkas sementara "
"dan melaporkan jika pembersihan gagal."

#: src/anduinos_rescue_center/app.py:648
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Open target terminal"
msgstr "Buka terminal target"

#: src/anduinos_rescue_center/app.py:653
#, python-brace-format
